      "description": "Machines whose most recent patch run inside the range returned a non-zero result. This is the tile that lets the board say something bad, which is why it is here rather than only on PDCTNG Patching.",
      "id": 1528077273
    },
    {
      "title": "Work run across the estate, without logging in",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "panels": [],
