      },
      "description": "What was changed on purpose: packages installed or upgraded, files written, services started. These are changes somebody asked for and got. Reads the busiest point in the selected range rather than this instant, because a converged estate is carrying no events right now and that is the normal resting state, not an empty week. **Puppet Enterprise manages itself with Puppet, so PE's own resources appear here beside your estate's** and can be the tallest bars on a quiet week: a type like `Pe_postgresql_psql` is the platform keeping its own database configured, not work anybody asked for. That is real work Puppet did, so it is not filtered out; it is worth knowing before reading the top of this list as a summary of your estate.",
